    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1728652454044\" id=\"item-67091c73530d68087645d170\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-video video-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/34418.js&quot;,&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.video\" data-sqsp-block=\"video\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n  <div class=\"intrinsic\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n    <div class=\"embed-block-wrapper\">\n      <div\n        class=\"sqs-native-video\"\n        data-config-settings=\"\"\n        data-config-video=\"{&quot;systemDataSourceType&quot;:&quot;mp4&quot;,&quot;alexandriaUrl&quot;:&quot;https://video.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/cced4516-44d8-405a-86a8-155eaa8b93c0/{variant}&quot;,&quot;durationSeconds&quot;:110.9108,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:1.7777777777777777,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;67091ca316fa4328b7b391dd&quot;,&quot;systemDataVariants&quot;:&quot;1920:1080,640:360&quot;,&quot;alexandriaLibraryId&quot;:&quot;66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32&quot;,&quot;audioCodec&quot;:&quot;aac&quot;,&quot;systemDataId&quot;:&quot;cced4516-44d8-405a-86a8-155eaa8b93c0&quot;,&quot;videoCodec&quot;:&quot;h264&quot;}\"\n        data-config-loading=\"\"\n        \n      >\n        <div\n          class=\"native-video-player\"\n          style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;\"\n        >\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433 .intrinsic {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-video-block-blend);\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-video-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433 .intrinsic {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n  <style>#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433 { border-width: 0; height: auto; }</style>\n  \n  \n  \n    <style>\n    \n      \n    \n      \n        @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433 { background-color: transparent; }\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_13433 .intrinsic { background-color: var(--tweak-video-block-background-color); }\n        }\n      \n    \n    </style>\n  \n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-a7090d5a4c4bfc38eaa7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Elegant Family Residence with Stunning Lake Views</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located at 6-21 Earnslaw Terrace, this contemporary home in Queenstown, New Zealand, blends comfort and luxury with an exceptional lakeside setting. Built on a spacious plot, this property showcases a floor plan that balances style and functionality, making it an ideal choice for both families and entertainers.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Property Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> 3</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> 2</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Areas:</strong> 1</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> Single, integrated</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Interior Highlights:</strong> The heart of this home is its generous living area, bathed in natural light, with seamless flow to the outdoor terrace. The interior is adorned with a calming palette of cool blues and neutral tones, complemented by plush furnishings and modern decor. The open-plan kitchen is a chef\u2019s delight, featuring top-of-the-line appliances and sleek cabinetry.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Comfort and Privacy:</strong> Each bedroom is a serene retreat, offering peace and tranquility. The master bedroom boasts an en-suite bathroom and direct access to stunning views, ensuring a private space to relax and rejuvenate.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living:</strong> Step outside to a beautifully crafted terrace, perfect for alfresco dining and enjoying the panoramic views of Lake Wakatipu and the surrounding mountains. The outdoor area is thoughtfully designed for year-round enjoyment, complete with comfortable seating and lush landscaping.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Additional Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Modern amenities including a heat pump, double-glazed windows, and ample storage</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Proximity to local attractions and easy access to Queenstown's renowned outdoor activities</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This property promises an unrivaled lifestyle where every day feels like a vacation. Whether you're entertaining guests or enjoying a quiet evening with family, this home offers the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and breathtaking scenery.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Feel free to adjust the year, floor size, and land size details as necessary to fit the actual specifications of the property.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-0 span-0\"></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6709228478bc77700c995ef1&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;s